---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const description =
  'ChicanoDev shares practical Linux, DevOps, programming, and AI automation knowledge. Built on experience. Shared with everyone.';
---

<Base title="About" description={description}>
  <article class="content narrow">
    <h1>About ChicanoDev</h1>
    <p><strong>{site.tagline}</strong></p>
    <p>
      ChicanoDev is a place to share practical knowledge about Linux, programming, DevOps, infrastructure, and AI automation.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started this project because I believe experience and knowledge should be shared, not hoarded. I've been fortunate to spend decades working with computers, and I want to help others benefit from the things I've learned along the way.
    </p>
    <p>
      ChicanoDev is especially dedicated to helping Chicanos, Latinx people, LGBTQIA+ folks, and others who have historically been underrepresented in technology. But everyone who's here to learn is welcome.
    </p>

    <h2>Everyone belongs here</h2>
    <p>
      ChicanoDev is a welcoming space for people of all backgrounds, identities, and experience levels. Racism, sexism, homophobia, and transphobia have no place here.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you're writing your first shell script or managing production Kubernetes clusters, I hope you'll find something useful here.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site covers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Linux and the command line</li>
      <li>DevOps and platform engineering, including containers, Kubernetes, automation, CI/CD, and infrastructure</li>
      <li>Programming and development workflows with Neovim, tmux, Git, and the shell</li>
      <li>AI and automation</li>
      <li>Troubleshooting, and lessons from real engineering work</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Some articles will be for beginners. Others will assume you already live in a terminal. The longer story of why this site exists is in <a href="/posts/welcome/">Welcome to ChicanoDev</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Find ChicanoDev</h2>
    <p>
      The site is <a href={site.github}>github.com/chicanodev</a>. New articles are also on the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
